{"3722820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Onlympic Up!", "steam_appid": 3722820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>ONLYMPIC UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A torch… a bond of fate… and a challenging journey toward the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONLYMPIC UP</strong> is a cooperative 3D platformer where players are bound together by a fragile rope and a sacred mission: carry the Olympic torch to its divine destination above. Thrust into a prophetic calling, two characters must ascend together — or fall trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Bound Together, Rise Together</u></strong><br>Players are connected at the waist by a <strong>rope</strong>, not a chain. But beware: if the rope stretches too far, it snaps — and failure sends you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/689db91653712ddc71b47d53fd81cde7.poster.avif?t=1784116692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/689db91653712ddc71b47d53fd81cde7.webm?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/689db91653712ddc71b47d53fd81cde7.mp4?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Evolving Mechanics</u></strong> <br>From platform puzzles to <strong>rail grinding</strong> and <strong>FPS balloon-shooting sections</strong>, expect your skills and teamwork to be tested in unexpected ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.poster.avif?t=1784116692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.webm?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.mp4?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Challenging Platforms, Epic Climb</u></strong><br>Jump, climb, balance, and move in harmony. Only the most coordinated pairs will reach the summit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/66fa72b5d9343ca94be4bea0bb9f2eda.poster.avif?t=1784116692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/66fa72b5d9343ca94be4bea0bb9f2eda.webm?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/66fa72b5d9343ca94be4bea0bb9f2eda.mp4?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A Divine Beginning</u></strong><br>The journey starts during a sacred <strong>Olympic ceremony</strong>. A lightning strike, a mysterious voice, and a torch that binds your fate — the ascent begins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/6d9fc34966ff4e00564de1e4e39cad99.poster.avif?t=1784116692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/6d9fc34966ff4e00564de1e4e39cad99.webm?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/6d9fc34966ff4e00564de1e4e39cad99.mp4?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Checkpoint System</u></strong><br>When the rope breaks, it’s over — but not completely. You'll <strong>respawn at your last checkpoint</strong> to try again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>True Co-op Challenge</u></strong><br>This isn’t a solo climb. Bring a friend, stay close, and whatever you do — don’t let the rope break.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong><u>Not for the faint of heart — or the short-tempered.</u></strong><br>The torch must rise. Can you carry it together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/3175253476514c35f5302012eb2ff680.poster.avif?t=1784116692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/3175253476514c35f5302012eb2ff680.webm?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/3175253476514c35f5302012eb2ff680.mp4?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>ONLYMPIC UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A torch… a bond of fate… and a challenging journey toward the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONLYMPIC UP</strong> is a cooperative 3D platformer where players are bound together by a fragile rope and a sacred mission: carry the Olympic torch to its divine destination above. Thrust into a prophetic calling, two characters must ascend together — or fall trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Bound Together, Rise Together</u></strong><br>Players are connected at the waist by a <strong>rope</strong>, not a chain. But beware: if the rope stretches too far, it snaps — and failure sends you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/689db91653712ddc71b47d53fd81cde7.poster.avif?t=1784116692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/689db91653712ddc71b47d53fd81cde7.webm?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/689db91653712ddc71b47d53fd81cde7.mp4?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Evolving Mechanics</u></strong> <br>From platform puzzles to <strong>rail grinding</strong> and <strong>FPS balloon-shooting sections</strong>, expect your skills and teamwork to be tested in unexpected ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.poster.avif?t=1784116692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e0612469bfa9ded152e784503318.webm?t=1784116692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722820/extras/d866e06124